Performance Manager Rill adapter
================================

The PM-owned adapter implementation was initially migrated from the immutable
RillML v1.5.1 tag (commit cba9b3d2fb2c6a71cb9d4a02b18852171ad05a1b), paths
crates/rill-pm-adapter/Cargo.toml, crates/rill-pm-adapter/src/lib.rs, and
crates/rill-pm-adapter/src/main.rs. The migrated Rust code remains under the
MIT license and retains its protocol and attribution history.

The adapter links the crates.io rill-ml package at exact version 1.5.3. Its
license and transitive dependency notices are recorded by Cargo.lock and the
release SBOM generated by the repository CI.
